<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">JUDAS</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jude</para>
  <para style="toc2">JUDAS</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jud</para>
  <para style="mt1">JUDE</para>
  <para style="mt2">CCAKY</para>
  <para style="mt2">Jude</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Jude Kyate Ccaky</char> hynh zyntu hae nynh kae thua cite a ho hae paw ahme leipaw ccangpahtu hae kha raeringnaw pyanawpaw ccaky nynh thua. E dyntarawpaw ccaky lungkhu kya <char style="bk">Peter Ccaky Kyningnaw</char> te a lokunaw hae patae um zah, ccawzeitu nynh a ccawriatu hae kya “Pachia nynh a ccungccaw hae kya vaekheit te zungzae azaw lante a pya hae paw mih zynnaw kya tynkaring lan thadyn oh,” cite thaw a pyanaw hae paw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alungkhu Umpaw</para>
  <para style="io1">Byalaanmaw — 1-2</para>
  <para style="io1">Ziazae, ccangpyanaw te ahme leipaw ccangpahtu hae thangnaw — 3-16</para>
  <para style="io1">Raeringnaw Pyanaw te Hyynaw — 17-23</para>
  <para style="io1">Hythua pyanaw — 24-25</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu Khri seepaw, James neitawpaw kae, Jude nynh Paaw Pachia sungsahnaw kya um hae paw, Jesu Khri thungkhawnaw kya um hae zah ko athua hae paw kalan ccaw kae ky oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">v.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:55">Mat 13.55</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:3">Mar 6.3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngaethyaumsahnaw, daenaw te sungsakunaw tuh nae kya la lungthung sah.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ahme leipaw Ccangpahtu hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka sungsah hae, aening nynh ah mue kalang oh paw khumnaw kong kha nae kalan zei lan thawte ka zuakuh lyakhe, mithyaa hae kalan vaekheit te zungzae cia a la pya hae paw zynnaw hanlan thawte na dou nawlan oh nanning kha hyy khylan ccaw zei aho cite ka muih. <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawccecize ccungccaw abang tuh aphirute oun tee vae hae, minmin tuh Pachia thawccinaw kha ohhuaku rynaw lang a rulae hae paw, Pachia pawlangria lei hae paw te a makhae kyalyapaw Bawipaw te ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri kha a vua hae paw thua hae zah, langmawpi te byapianaw teing lan nungdae athua hae paw nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nanning nynh na la ny vae oh zemah bua kae liathuisah ry oh paw tuh, Bawipaw nynh Israel hae kha Izip ram kyate a khum kou hae te, a zyn lei hae paw kha bua a ro hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">v.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:51">Exo 12.51</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:29-30">Nam 14.29-30</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Mimaw kawhoinaw lungkhu um leite mih umnaw hmin a cciataw hae paw vaaw hae kha byapia khylan alesaepaw nin kyacia Pachia nynh mohnaw kyakhe zungzae atynpaw sivawrui te phang a khung hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuhawte Sodom te Gomorrah te mih pepan e khuapi hae mah tuh-e hae hawte nopi pise seinaw rae hae zah, aphung thua leipaw chiisaw rynaw kalan a zuiku hae keiccuze zungzae maee te detahnaw kha teing hae zah, dosuinkupaw lang a tang hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">v.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:1-24">Gen 19.1-24</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuhawte hynh-e maan a sahtu hae nynh mah mih pynsaw kha a thusaku hae, Pachia kawhoinaw kha pawlangria leite a lesae hae paw kha thethya a ho hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuasalama vaaw lupi Mikhael tuh Moses a rhua konglang te Satan ryte doukuh hae zah bya he a eikuh hae tuh, Satan kha saryate seibenaw bya honua ngan leite, “Bawipaw nynh nang kha ae pe sah,” cite kyalya a hopya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">v.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:13">Dan 10.13</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 10:21">21</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 12:1">12.1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:7">Bya 12.7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 34:6">Deu 34.6</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 3:2">Zek 3.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuasalama hynh-e ccungccaw hae nynh a ny lei hae paw uccaw hae kong kha thethya a ho hae; nythyanaw a hoi lei hae paw sarangpaw hae hawte puikhaepaw mih nynaw khate mimaw toulou kha a rosaku hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Minmin hanlan ngaethya lan kou um! Pawccecize minmin nynh Kain laanpi kha a zui hae, amee mue khylan Balaam a cyiseinaw kalan khe a dekuh bua hae, Korah hawte rhawtho hae zah tuh-e rhawthonaw kyakhe a roh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">v.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:3-8">Gen 4.3-8</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 22:1-35">Nam 22.1-35</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 16:1-35">16.1-35</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Vaeccawkunaw poi tuakute nanning ryte na aekheih lya oh khe, maethya ny leite mimaw kyalya looh a dangkuh hae paw, athupaw abekuhpaw nynh thua hae. Minmin tuh khisan nynh a cciakhaepaw khuaatui a um leipaw maeking hawte thua hae zah, atharui kyate khohbia hae paw vae ning chihpaw, athae a um leipaw tangvaw ccyh e thingku hae hawte nynh athua hae; <verse number="13" style="v" />mimaw maethyanaw kha tuiphue hawte a pousahpaw rili tuileih kou rupaw hawte thua hae zah a zou bungthungpaw awsi hae hawte nynh athua hae, tuh-e awsi hae hanlan marae zipaw mohnaw kha zungzae paccynpya athua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Adam kyate she sarinaw athuapaw Enok mah hynh-e hae kong hynh profehbya a ho. A hopaw tuh: “Dotua, Bawipaw tuh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">v.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 5:18">Gen 5.18</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 5:21-24">21-24</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />ccungccaw balyn kha byapia khylan, Pachia pawlangria lei hae paw balyn nynh Pachia pawlangria leite a cyi hae paw mih cyisahnaw balyn hanlan thuasah, Pachia pawlangria lei hae paw misei hae nynh amaw kha rawsete rehahan lan a ho hae paw mih bya hanlan thuasah byapia khylan riatae leipaw a mithyaa hae ryte yn thua cih,” a ci. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuh-e hae tuh palei ccohkuh hae paw, milae seinaw a ccungpahtu hae te mih pynsaw rynaw thyhte a hiin hae paw nynh thua hae; mih khalang te tansakunaw bya kha ho hae zah, mimaw amia muenaw elang ming hae kha leih a poo hae.</para>
  <para style="s">Raeringnaw Pyanaw te Hyynaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thuasalama ka sungsah hae, ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri a locceihtu hae nynh langmawlya te a la hodae hae paw bya hae kha la liathui oh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “Nyathyakou ccyh kya, Pachia pawlangria leite mih pynsaw rynaw thyhte a hiin hae paw, ccungccaw saryatu hae oun langkuh cih hae,” cite ae hopya oh paw kha la liathui oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">v.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:3">2Pe 3.3</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuh-e ccungccaw hae tuh ccungccaw a phiasakuh hae paw, Muisaw hoi leite pynsaw kya a hoysah hae paw nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thuasalama ka sungsah hae, nanning tuh athyaa huaccepaw nae zynnaw vawlan khe palei lethung oh lah, Thyaa Muisaw kya sawsang oh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Pachia sungsahnaw kya tyn oh lah, zungzae hiinnaw hanlan ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri kya-e ngaethyaumsahnaw kha ngaehoi oh. <verse number="22" style="v" />Lunghiinnaw a hoi hae paw kha thawccih oh; <verse number="23" style="v" />ccungccaw abang kha maee lungkhu kyate thuaa oh lah, khum oh; pynsaw keiccu anungsikuhpaw boeining kha heize hua oh lah, rawrinaw te minmin kha thawccih oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Athangnaw Sawsang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nanning kha khuliakunaw kyate na khyn nawlan oh ae rin kho oh zah, seinaw hoi leite lungtuanaw ryte a phu-enaw a umnaw malang ae thuakhae kho oh paw, <verse number="25" style="v" />aening oun Khumtu, a makhae kyalyapaw Pachia tungvaw kya phu-enaw, lesaenaw, uknaw kaw te kawhoinaw tuh ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri liate atu te zungzae cia la um sah. Amen.</para>
</usx>